m(3,"Cultural battle","The cultural and intellectual battle is about the value we place on…","Sufficiency, free time and planetary habitability",["Technological progress, growth and competitiveness","National sovereignty, security and borders","Property rights, markets and profits"],"The report calls for the end of “classless ecology”.",2);
vf(3,"The Platform could be implemented with an incomplete coalition of countries, for example without the US or China.",true,"True: other countries could impose corrective tariffs on non-participants.",2);
